{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2022-01-31 09:00:00', 'title': 'MARY DRAVES TO RETIRE FROM DOW; ANDRE ARGENTON NAMED VICE PRESIDENT, EH&S, AND CHIEF SUSTAINABILITY OFFICER', 'text': 'MIDLAND, MICH., JAN. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DOW\xa0(NYSE: DOW) TODAY ANNOUNCES THAT MARY DRAVES, VICE PRESIDENT OF ENVIRONMENT, HEALTH AND SAFETY (EH&S) AND CHIEF SUSTAINABILITY OFFICER, HAS ANNOUNCED HER DECISION TO RETIRE IN APRIL 2022, FOLLOWING MORE THAN 32 YEARS OF SERVICE WITH DOW.'}